  "translate_en|mods/[SVRP] ClassicBows/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox_EN.txt|Sandbox_SVRPClassicBows_AimingXPMultiplier_tooltip": "Multiplies the base Aiming XP awarded when attacking or killing zombies with bows and crossbows. (Default: 1.0)",
